{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bf71cf3ddb4c43b317ed400559a674639cbb917f09311c9706e6d9b83ca9b681","ja":"ウォークラリー大会は、\nクイズに答えながら、進んでいくことになっていて……","zh":"徒步越野大会的规则是，\n要一边回答猜谜题目一边前进……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e9ef27c21ed75420b29d2add778f0db38bc2b92472788c1cbf1dbd818d4d9310","ja":"次の問題は……りんごが3つ並んでるわ。\nええと……「りんごの名称を、順に答えよ」！？","zh":"下一题是……摆着3个苹果。\n唔……“请按顺序回答苹果的名称”！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3e9d26ebb088be164efcae7c656dd25277f0892f82d2c996a24bbabaa6367e40","ja":"一番左が王林で、その次がシナノスイート。\n最後はジョナゴールドだべさ！","zh":"最左边的是王林，接着是信浓甜。\n最后是红玉苹果呗！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"175fe9c4d242e0c53160c65fc7002d8770db2516d9c2dbce834b5e3fcba80ae2","ja":"木下さんすごい……！　また正解だわ。","zh":"木下同学好厉害……！又答对了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"fb57cdb383e3ab1b4777528e72c0d5043ac92d6396c2dde4d7c55cedd2f8df60","ja":"えへへ、たまたま知ってる問題だったからねぇ。\nあたしたちはチームだから、助け合って進むべさ！","zh":"嘿嘿，只是碰巧遇到了我知道的题目啦。\n我们是一个团队，就该互相帮助着前进嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7be508a2d4b5fe421865dca4d04df86c7a847fc3ac6dee1fbbd043cb198c68bd","ja":"次は「野菜の目利き！　写真のうち、取れたて新鮮の\n小松菜はどれか」ね。どこが違うのかしら……？","zh":"接下来是“蔬菜鉴别！照片中新鲜采摘的\n小松菜是哪一颗”对吧。到底有什么区别呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"bf50395d300cc002d61150e66cf5aba2cb9f6f6b94f3037fd62cb10d0202e2c2","ja":"どれも葉っぱがしっかり緑色ですけど、茎も緑っぽくて\n葉がピンとしてる2番の小松菜が一番新鮮です！","zh":"虽然每捆的叶子都很翠绿，但茎也带绿意、\n叶片挺拔的2号小松菜才是最挺拔新鲜的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"d52ac8148522e34b109d50de30c1dcf4eccc83a3b06a4e9a3ed1223181719dfc","ja":"すごい……即答ね。\nさすが、いつも料理してるだけあるわ。","zh":"厉害……回答得真快。\n真不愧是平时经常做料理的人。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8fbb9e6771144e0732a625258815ab3c3910358a4de86e6165d93dafd7f72d0c","ja":"えへへ♪　お野菜とか果物の問題が多くて良かった\nなーって！　賞品がお野菜と果物だからでしょうか？","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 出了好多关于蔬菜和水果的题目，\n太好啦！是因为奖品是蔬菜和水果吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"befa41bdd4e66accd25ac6fdc1f97e737aae2e7527861358f5e9ef743fb8ccdf","ja":"（ここまで高槻さんも木下さんも4問正解。\n私はまだ1問も……）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c65b91ae91a60f11708afbfd25bd337a58c9d0a3b4e223a87328a0e72e4f5375","ja":"千早さん、どうしたんだい？","zh":"千早小姐，怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1129.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"aba4edc0d02127f9d39b9ec3d33a0c35c8cdcf235c5c55ce97d8df3703a8830e","ja":"……あ。いえ、気にしないで。今度こそ……えっ！？\n次が最終スポット！？","zh":"……啊。不，别在意。下次一定……诶！？\n下一个就是最后一个地点了！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
